# Zecruu Games - Cursor Rules

## Project Overview
Online gaming platform with Texas Hold'em Poker and Dots Survivor games.

## Lessons
- Branch name is `master`, not `main`
- Use semicolons in PowerShell to chain commands (not `&&`)
- Server runs on port 3001 (production) or 3002 (local dev)
- This folder was a zip dump with no .git — `git init` + `remote add origin`, default branch is master
- html/body overflow:hidden + position:fixed prevents position:sticky from pinning the poker action bar; use position:fixed on mobile
- Poker client is duplicated in `games/poker` and `hub/public/games/poker` — update both
- Blackjack multiplayer: host is the dealer bank, joiner is the only player; rooms cap at 2
- The animation/experience engine is **Rive** (rive.app), not "Rise". GameKit-for-Flutter is a stale preview; current path is Apple `RiveRuntime` + Luau + optional GPU Canvas
- Rive GPU Canvas compiles WGSL to Metal on iOS but is a low-level GPU API, not a horde/3D engine; official GLTF/lighting libraries were still a production gap
- Shipping any iOS game still needs a Mac, Apple Developer Program, and (after 2026-04-28) Xcode 26 + iOS 26 SDK — Linux cannot archive an IPA
- Necromancer/mage iOS survivor is **2D** when art is sprite sheets and the world is procedural; 3D billboards waste battery and hide the army. Cap summons; overflow = stats/novas. Godot 2D + atlases + pooling, not uncapped entities

